{"title":"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Brute_Force)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Brute Force)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Reasoning)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Reasoning)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_BoundlessBrain!\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by BoundlessBrain!</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/c/2ccecd44a38fc1bbe370bf9bdbfae6dc63c6c87f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10^7}{5\\times 10^4}=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"79\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/0/b005c0ed431ae66386637b566a291c949aff93c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ .002 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ .2 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 20 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 200 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 2000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"412\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Cancelling powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> yields:<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/3/3536b089241f9f97a48d7f231711caaf7a16b7f9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{10^7}{5 \\times 10^4} = \\frac{10^3}{5} = \\frac{1000}{5} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 200}\\]\" width=\"276\" height=\"39\" /> \n(Reverted a Mistake)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Brute_Force.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Brute_Force)\">Solution 2 (Brute Force)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Brute Force)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/2/0a2371b5a7bc3dd3b386e2be0ab52ffe579e06c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10^7}{5\\times 10^4}=\\frac{10000000}{50000}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 200}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"262\" height=\"42\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Reasoning.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Reasoning)\">Solution 3 (Reasoning)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Reasoning)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As we can see, the numerator is way larger than the denominator so answer choices <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/d/92d2ad84bd3c74ba447d62031cb4474d4090c13b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ .002$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/a/1aa165bd86b1f6d0b859d3fc68bb468cb8350438.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(B)}\\ .2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/8/9d81cd76f1b978aca98e3d98b7df2ded3fa868fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(C)}\\ 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"18\" /> are eliminated. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/1/b415e306a5349d8f73b11b7e21e5cf954cc904e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10^7}{10^4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"31\" height=\"41\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, but in this question the expression, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/f/7df01f33ec3b20a3249440984a9cdf18568e36b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10^7}{5 \\times 10^4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"63\" height=\"42\" />, is smaller than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> since the denominator is larger than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/9/ed99f78014bdf57b62e04864d28c977b06fb23ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"17\" />. Therefore the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/4/5941217f44e5b4b9a15a41bfd5126538f3cc5fec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 200}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"75\" height=\"30\" />.\n~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Shunyipanda&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Shunyipanda (page does not exist)\">shunyipanda</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_BoundlessBrain.21\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_BoundlessBrain!\">Video Solution by BoundlessBrain!</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by BoundlessBrain!\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/BfFv227egOg\">https://youtu.be/BfFv227egOg</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/KW5HexBjEHU\">https://youtu.be/KW5HexBjEHU</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/inde